# A project's Pages: listed on the tab rail with the newest open, a call's page opened there,
# then a worker's pages in its lead's chat, one opened in Pages.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies pages.json
project storefront shop
patch pages-notes.diff
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Plan the product page cache and show me the numbers."
settle 10
front Wren
settle 2
key cmd-alt-8
settle 3
snap pages-library
front Wren
settle 5
click "Which store should the product page cache use?"
settle 5
snap pages-call
click 1036,284
settle 3
snap pages-call-open
front Wren
settle 10
snap pages-chat
click 526,410
settle 3
snap pages-chat-open
